# 🏠 Civil Floor Plan Generator (1800 sqft) - Python + DXF

This project uses Python and the `ezdxf` library to generate a professional-style 2D civil plan layout of a 30x60 ft (1800 sqft) house with:

✅ North-facing  
✅ 9-inch walls  
✅ Car parking area  
✅ Staircase outside  
✅ 2 windows per room  
✅ AutoCAD-compatible .dxf output

